    "text": "<h2>Список меню</h2>\r\n<h1>Навігація</h1>\r\n<ul>\r\n        <li>\r\n        \r\n<a href=\"https://techno4.online/фреймворк/#general\">Макет меню списку</a>\r\n\r\n    </li>\r\n        <li>\r\n        \r\n<div>Приклад</div>\r\n\r\n    </li>\r\n    </ul>\r\n<h3>Список меню</h3>\r\n<div>Список меню є розширенням перегляду списку. Список меню, на відміну від звичайного списку посилань, призначений для вказівки поточного активного екрана (або розділу) вашого застосунку. Подумайте про це як про Tabbar, але у формі списку.</div>\r\n<h3>Макет списку меню</h3>\r\n<div>Подивімось на структуру макета списків меню у ваших переглядах списків:</div>\r\n<pre><code>&lt;div class=&quot;list menu-list&quot;&gt;\r\n  &lt;ul&gt;\r\n    &lt;li&gt;\r\n      &lt;a href=&quot;#&quot; class=&quot;item-content item-link item-selected&quot;&gt;\r\n        &lt;div class=&quot;item-inner&quot;&gt;\r\n          &lt;div class=&quot;item-title&quot;&gt;Item 1&lt;/div&gt;\r\n        &lt;/div&gt;\r\n      &lt;/a&gt;\r\n    &lt;/li&gt;\r\n    &lt;li&gt;\r\n      &lt;a href=&quot;#&quot; class=&quot;item-content item-link&quot;&gt;\r\n        &lt;div class=&quot;item-inner&quot;&gt;\r\n          &lt;div class=&quot;item-title&quot;&gt;Item 2&lt;/div&gt;\r\n        &lt;/div&gt;\r\n      &lt;/a&gt;\r\n    &lt;/li&gt;\r\n    ...\r\n  &lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;</code></pre>\r\n<div>Де\r\n<p>●\t<code>menu-list </code> - додатковий клас, який необхідно додати до списку, щоб увімкнути відображення списку меню</p>\r\n<p>○\t<code>item-selected</code> -додатковий клас додав пункт списку меню, щоб вказати, що це наразі активний пункт</p>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3>Приклад </h3>\r\n<pre><code>&lt;template&gt;\r\n  &lt;div class=&quot;page&quot;&gt;\r\n    &lt;div class=&quot;navbar&quot;&gt;\r\n      &lt;div class=&quot;navbar-bg&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n      &lt;div class=&quot;navbar-inner sliding&quot;&gt;\r\n        &lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Menu List&lt;/div&gt;\r\n      &lt;/div&gt;\r\n    &lt;/div&gt;\r\n    &lt;div class=&quot;page-content&quot;&gt;\r\n      &lt;div class=&quot;block block-strong&quot;&gt;\r\n        &lt;p&gt;Список меню, на відміну від звичайного списку посилань, призначений для вказівки поточного активного екрана (або розділу) вашої програми. Подумайте про це як про Tabbar, але у формі списку.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n      &lt;/div&gt;\r\n      &lt;div class=&quot;list menu-list&quot;&gt;\r\n        &lt;ul&gt;\r\n          &lt;li&gt;\r\n            &lt;a\r\n              href=&quot;#&quot;\r\n              class=&quot;item-content item-link ${selected === 'home' ? 'item-selected' : ''}&quot;\r\n              @click=${()=&gt; setItem('home')}\r\n            &gt;\r\n              &lt;div class=&quot;item-media&quot;&gt;\r\n                &lt;i class=&quot;icon material-icons if-md&quot;&gt;home&lt;/i&gt;\r\n                &lt;i class=&quot;icon t4-icons if-not-md&quot;&gt;house&lt;/i&gt;\r\n              &lt;/div&gt;\r\n              &lt;div class=&quot;item-inner&quot;&gt;\r\n                &lt;div class=&quot;item-title&quot;&gt;Home&lt;/div&gt;\r\n              &lt;/div&gt;\r\n            &lt;/a&gt;\r\n          &lt;/li&gt;\r\n          &lt;li&gt;\r\n            &lt;a\r\n              href=&quot;#&quot;\r\n              class=&quot;item-content item-link ${selected === 'profile' ? 'item-selected' : ''}&quot;\r\n              @click=${()=&gt; setItem('profile')}\r\n            &gt;\r\n              &lt;div class=&quot;item-media&quot;&gt;\r\n                &lt;i class=&quot;icon material-icons if-md&quot;&gt;person&lt;/i&gt;\r\n                &lt;i class=&quot;icon t4-icons if-not-md&quot;&gt;person_fill&lt;/i&gt;\r\n              &lt;/div&gt;\r\n              &lt;div class=&quot;item-inner&quot;&gt;\r\n                &lt;div class=&quot;item-title&quot;&gt;Profile&lt;/div&gt;\r\n              &lt;/div&gt;\r\n            &lt;/a&gt;\r\n          &lt;/li&gt;\r\n          &lt;li&gt;\r\n            &lt;a\r\n              href=&quot;#&quot;\r\n              class=&quot;item-content item-link ${selected === 'settings' ? 'item-selected' : ''}&quot;\r\n              @click=${()=&gt; setItem('settings')}\r\n            &gt;\r\n              &lt;div class=&quot;item-media&quot;&gt;\r\n                &lt;i class=&quot;icon material-icons if-md&quot;&gt;settings&lt;/i&gt;\r\n                &lt;i class=&quot;icon t4-icons if-not-md&quot;&gt;gear_alt_fill&lt;/i&gt;\r\n              &lt;/div&gt;\r\n              &lt;div class=&quot;item-inner&quot;&gt;\r\n                &lt;div class=&quot;item-title&quot;&gt;Settings&lt;/div&gt;\r\n              &lt;/div&gt;\r\n            &lt;/a&gt;\r\n          &lt;/li&gt;\r\n        &lt;/ul&gt;\r\n      &lt;/div&gt;\r\n      &lt;div class=&quot;list media-list menu-list&quot;&gt;\r\n        &lt;ul&gt;\r\n          &lt;li&gt;\r\n            &lt;a\r\n              href=&quot;#&quot;\r\n              class=&quot;item-content item-link ${selectedMedia === 'home' ? 'item-selected' : ''}&quot;\r\n              @click=${()=&gt; setItemMedia('home')}\r\n            &gt;\r\n              &lt;div class=&quot;item-media&quot;&gt;\r\n                &lt;i class=&quot;icon material-icons if-md&quot;&gt;home&lt;/i&gt;\r\n                &lt;i class=&quot;icon t4-icons if-not-md&quot;&gt;house&lt;/i&gt;\r\n              &lt;/div&gt;\r\n              &lt;div class=&quot;item-inner&quot;&gt;\r\n                &lt;div class=&quot;item-title-wrap&quot;&gt;\r\n                  &lt;div class=&quot;item-title&quot;&gt;Home&lt;/div&gt;\r\n                &lt;/div&gt;\r\n                &lt;div class=&quot;item-subtitle&quot;&gt;Home subtitle&lt;/div&gt;\r\n              &lt;/div&gt;\r\n            &lt;/a&gt;\r\n          &lt;/li&gt;\r\n          &lt;li&gt;\r\n            &lt;a\r\n              href=&quot;#&quot;\r\n              class=&quot;item-content item-link ${selectedMedia === 'profile' ? 'item-selected' : ''}&quot;\r\n              @click=${()=&gt; setItemMedia('profile')}\r\n            &gt;\r\n              &lt;div class=&quot;item-media&quot;&gt;\r\n                &lt;i class=&quot;icon material-icons if-md&quot;&gt;person&lt;/i&gt;\r\n                &lt;i class=&quot;icon t4-icons if-not-md&quot;&gt;person_fill&lt;/i&gt;\r\n              &lt;/div&gt;\r\n              &lt;div class=&quot;item-inner&quot;&gt;\r\n                &lt;div class=&quot;item-title-wrap&quot;&gt;\r\n                  &lt;div class=&quot;item-title&quot;&gt;Profile&lt;/div&gt;\r\n                &lt;/div&gt;\r\n                &lt;div class=&quot;item-subtitle&quot;&gt;Profile subtitle&lt;/div&gt;\r\n              &lt;/div&gt;\r\n            &lt;/a&gt;\r\n          &lt;/li&gt;\r\n          &lt;li&gt;\r\n            &lt;a\r\n              href=&quot;#&quot;\r\n              class=&quot;item-content item-link ${selectedMedia === 'settings' ? 'item-selected' : ''}&quot;\r\n              @click=${()=&gt; setItemMedia('settings')}\r\n            &gt;\r\n              &lt;div class=&quot;item-media&quot;&gt;\r\n                &lt;i class=&quot;icon material-icons if-md&quot;&gt;settings&lt;/i&gt;\r\n                &lt;i class=&quot;icon t4-icons if-not-md&quot;&gt;gear_alt_fill&lt;/i&gt;\r\n              &lt;/div&gt;\r\n              &lt;div class=&quot;item-inner&quot;&gt;\r\n                &lt;div class=&quot;item-title-wrap&quot;&gt;\r\n                  &lt;div class=&quot;item-title&quot;&gt;Settings&lt;/div&gt;\r\n                &lt;/div&gt;\r\n                &lt;div class=&quot;item-subtitle&quot;&gt;Settings subtitle&lt;/div&gt;\r\n              &lt;/div&gt;\r\n            &lt;/a&gt;\r\n          &lt;/li&gt;\r\n        &lt;/ul&gt;\r\n      &lt;/div&gt;\r\n    &lt;/div&gt;\r\n  &lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/template&gt;\r\n&lt;script&gt;\r\n  export default (props, { $update }) =&gt; {\r\n    let selected = 'home';\r\n    let selectedMedia = 'home';\r\n\r\n    const setItem = (newItem) =&gt; {\r\n      selected = newItem;\r\n      $update();\r\n    }\r\n    const setItemMedia = (newItem) =&gt; {\r\n      selectedMedia = newItem;\r\n      $update();\r\n    }\r\n    return $render;\r\n  }\r\n&lt;/script&gt;</code></pre>\r\n <!-- {\"type\":\"layout\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"section\",\"props\":{\"id\":\"general\",\"image_position\":\"center-center\",\"style\":\"primary\",\"title_breakpoint\":\"xl\",\"title_position\":\"top-left\",\"title_rotation\":\"left\",\"vertical_align\":\"middle\",\"width\":\"large\"},\"children\":[{\"type\":\"row\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"column\",\"props\":{\"image_position\":\"center-center\",\"position_sticky_breakpoint\":\"m\",\"preserve_color\":true,\"style\":\"tile-muted\"},\"children\":[{\"type\":\"headline\",\"props\":{\"content\":\"\\u0421\\u043f\\u0438\\u0441\\u043e\\u043a \\u043c\\u0435\\u043d\\u044e\",\"title_element\":\"h2\",\"title_style\":\"heading-small\"},\"name\":\"\\u0421\\u043f\\u0438\\u0441\\u043e\\u043a \\u043c\\u0435\\u043d\\u044e\"},{\"type\":\"headline\",\"props\":{\"content\":\"\\u041d\\u0430\\u0432\\u0456\\u0433\\u0430\\u0446\\u0456\\u044f\",\"title_decoration\":\"line\",\"title_element\":\"h1\",\"title_style\":\"h4\"},\"name\":\"\\u041f\\u0456\\u0434\\u0437\\u0430\\u0433\\u043e\\u043b\\u043e\\u0432\\u043e\\u043a \\u041d\\u0410\\u0412\\u0406\\u0413\\u0410\\u0426\\u0406\\u042f\"},{\"type\":\"nav\",\"props\":{\"grid\":\"1\",\"image_vertical_align\":true,\"nav_style\":\"secondary\",\"show_image\":true,\"show_meta\":true},\"children\":[{\"type\":\"nav_item\",\"props\":{\"content\":\"\\u041c\\u0430\\u043a\\u0435\\u0442 \\u043c\\u0435\\u043d\\u044e \\u0441\\u043f\\u0438\\u0441\\u043a\\u0443\",\"link\":\"https:\\/\\/techno4.online\\/\\u0444\\u0440\\u0435\\u0439\\u043c\\u0432\\u043e\\u0440\\u043a\\/#general\"}},{\"type\":\"nav_item\",\"props\":{\"content\":\"\\u041f\\u0440\\u0438\\u043a\\u043b\\u0430\\u0434\"}}],\"name\":\"\\u041d\\u0430\\u0432\\u0456\\u0433\\u0430\\u0446\\u0456\\u044f\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"row\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"column\",\"props\":{\"image_position\":\"center-center\",\"position_sticky_breakpoint\":\"m\",\"style\":\"tile-default\",\"width_medium\":\"3-4\"},\"children\":[{\"type\":\"headline\",\"props\":{\"content\":\"\\u0421\\u043f\\u0438\\u0441\\u043e\\u043a \\u043c\\u0435\\u043d\\u044e\",\"title_element\":\"h3\",\"title_style\":\"h3\"},\"name\":\"\\u041d\\u0430\\u0437\\u0432\\u0430 \\u0440\\u043e\\u0437\\u0434\\u0456\\u043b\\u0443 - \\u0421\\u043f\\u0438\\u0441\\u043e\\u043a \\u043c\\u0435\\u043d\\u044e\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"props\":{\"column_breakpoint\":\"m\",\"content\":\"\\u0421\\u043f\\u0438\\u0441\\u043e\\u043a \\u043c\\u0435\\u043d\\u044e \\u0454 \\u0440\\u043e\\u0437\\u0448\\u0438\\u0440\\u0435\\u043d\\u043d\\u044f\\u043c \\u043f\\u0435\\u0440\\u0435\\u0433\\u043b\\u044f\\u0434\\u0443 \\u0441\\u043f\\u0438\\u0441\\u043a\\u0443. \\u0421\\u043f\\u0438\\u0441\\u043e\\u043a \\u043c\\u0435\\u043d\\u044e, \\u043d\\u0430 \\u0432\\u0456\\u0434\\u043c\\u0456\\u043d\\u0443 \\u0432\\u0456\\u0434 \\u0437\\u0432\\u0438\\u0447\\u0430\\u0439\\u043d\\u043e\\u0433\\u043e \\u0441\\u043f\\u0438\\u0441\\u043a\\u0443 \\u043f\\u043e\\u0441\\u0438\\u043b\\u0430\\u043d\\u044c, \\u043f\\u0440\\u0438\\u0437\\u043d\\u0430\\u0447\\u0435\\u043d\\u0438\\u0439 \\u0434\\u043b\\u044f \\u0432\\u043a\\u0430\\u0437\\u0456\\u0432\\u043a\\u0438 \\u043f\\u043e\\u0442\\u043e\\u0447\\u043d\\u043e\\u0433\\u043e \\u0430\\u043a\\u0442\\u0438\\u0432\\u043d\\u043e\\u0433\\u043e \\u0435\\u043a\\u0440\\u0430\\u043d\\u0430 (\\u0430\\u0431\\u043e \\u0440\\u043e\\u0437\\u0434\\u0456\\u043b\\u0443) \\u0432\\u0430\\u0448\\u043e\\u0433\\u043e \\u0437\\u0430\\u0441\\u0442\\u043e\\u0441\\u0443\\u043d\\u043a\\u0443. \\u041f\\u043e\\u0434\\u0443\\u043c\\u0430\\u0439\\u0442\\u0435 \\u043f\\u0440\\u043e \\u0446\\u0435 \\u044f\\u043a \\u043f\\u0440\\u043e Tabbar, \\u0430\\u043b\\u0435 \\u0443 \\u0444\\u043e\\u0440\\u043c\\u0456 \\u0441\\u043f\\u0438\\u0441\\u043a\\u0443.\",\"margin\":\"default\",\"text_style\":\"large\"},\"name\":\"\\u041e\\u043f\\u0438\\u0441\"},{\"type\"